# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API)
#
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key (note: daily reset limit, not for production)
# 5. Copy it into `.env.local` as VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
#
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API
# Restrict by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
